    {
      "id": "blk-0287",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第1题 请结合你的生活经验，说说什么是人机工程学，并举一个你生活中遇到的人机工程学问题的例子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0288",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0289",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "人机工程学是研究人、机器和环境之间关系的学科。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0290",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "目的是让机器适应人，让人用起来舒服、安全、高效。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0291",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：椅子坐久了腰疼，说明椅子没有考虑人的脊柱曲线。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0292",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：手机屏幕在阳光下看不清，说明显示设计没有考虑使用环境。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0293",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "人机工程学就是让产品好用、好操作、不累人。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第2题 你平时用的椅子坐着舒服吗？请从人机工程学角度分析，一把好椅子应该具备哪些特点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0296",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "椅背有腰托，支撑腰椎，维持脊柱自然曲线。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0297",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "坐垫软硬适中，久坐不塌陷。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0298",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "座椅高度可调，让大腿基本水平、小腿自然垂直。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0299",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "扶手高度合适，手臂自然放松。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0300",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "椅背可后仰，缓解长时间坐姿的疲劳。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第3题 请举例说明你生活中遇到的显示装置设计不合理的问题，并说说应该怎么改进。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0302",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0303",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：手机在阳光下屏幕看不清，亮度不够、反光严重。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0304",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：提高屏幕亮度，增加防眩光涂层。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0305",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：遥控器按键太小，图标看不清。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0306",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：常用按键做大、字迹清晰、颜色对比强。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0307",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：电梯楼层显示字体太小，老人看不清。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0308",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：加大字体，提高对比度。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0309",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第4题 你平时用手机时，哪些操作让你觉得不顺手？请从人机交互角度分析，并说说怎么改进。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0310",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0311",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：手机太大，单手够不到屏幕另一侧。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0312",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：把常用功能放在拇指容易够到的区域。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0313",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：App按钮太小，容易点错。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0314",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：按钮至少大于手指指腹面积，通常不小于44像素。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0315",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：指纹解锁手湿就解不开。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0316",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：增加面部识别等多种解锁方式。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0317",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第5题 请举例说明你生活中遇到的操纵装置设计不合理的问题，并说说应该怎么改进。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0318",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0319",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：门把手是圆球形，手湿拧不开。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0320",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：换成杠杆式下压把手，更省力。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0321",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：炒锅手柄太细，端起来勒手。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0322",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：手柄加粗，增加防滑软垫。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0323",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：水杯盖子太紧，老人拧不开。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0324",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：增加摩擦力，或改成按压式开盖。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0325",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第6题 你戴过可穿戴设备吗？比如智能手表、手环。请从人机工程学角度说说，好的可穿戴设备应该注意什么。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0326",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0327",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "佩戴舒适，表带柔软贴合，不勒手腕。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0328",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "重量轻，不增加手腕负担。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0329",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "屏幕在阳光下能看清，夜晚不刺眼。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0330",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "操作简单，抬手就能看信息。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0331",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "续航时间长，不用天天充电。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0332",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "运动时不会滑落，防水防汗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "6.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0333",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第7题 你去过商场、医院、地铁站等公共场所，有没有发现空间设计不合理的地方？请举例说明并给出改进建议。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0334",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0335",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：地铁扶手太高，矮个子够不到。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0336",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "改进：增加拉环或降低扶手高度。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0337",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "例子：医院座椅没有扶手，老人起身困难。",
